          "icon": "quote",
          "fill": "$accent"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sk199",
          "x": 160,
          "y": 218,
          "name": "引用 标题",
          "content": "合成控制法 (Synthetic Control Method)",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 17,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sk200",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 268,
          "name": "引用 文1",
          "content": "SCM 最早由 Abadie and Gardeazabal (2003) 提出，用来研究西班牙巴斯克地区恐怖活动的经济成本，属于案例研究范畴 (Case Study)。Athey & Imbens (2017) 认为它是过去 15 年计量方法领域最重要的创新。",
          "fill": "$gray",
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1040,
          "lineHeight": 1.7
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
          "id": "sk201",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 356,
          "name": "引用 内线",
          "width": 1040,
          "height": 1,
          "fill": "$line"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sk202",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 380,
          "name": "引用 文2",
          "content": "合成控制法的基本思想是：虽然无法找到巴斯克地区的最佳控制地区，但可对西班牙的若干大城市进行适当的线性组合（赋予不同的权重），以构造一个更为贴切的「合成控制地区」(Synthetic Control Region)，然后将真实的巴斯克地区与「合成的巴斯克地区」进行对比，即可得到恐袭的影响。",
          "fill": "$gray",
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1040,
          "lineHeight": 1.7
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
          "id": "sk203",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 678,
          "name": "引用 页脚线",
          "width": 1120,
          "height": 1,
          "fill": "$line"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sk204",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 690,
          "name": "引用 页脚左",
          "content": "PART 06 · QUOTE",
          "fill": "$faint",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 1.5
        },
        {
